---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Information | FenceCraft" description="Privacy information for the FenceCraft website preview.">
  <section class="wrap page-title"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p><h1>Privacy information.</h1><p class="intro">This preview is intentionally simple and does not send or store enquiry form data.</p></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap narrow editorial"><h2>Preview behaviour</h2><p>The enquiry form validates details in your browser only. It is not connected to a real endpoint and no submission confirmation is shown as if an enquiry had been sent.</p><h2>Before launch</h2><p>Connect the form to an approved enquiry endpoint, add the final privacy notice and confirm retention, access and contact details with the business owner before publishing.</p><h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>No analytics or advertising cookies are included in this preview.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
